1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,494
One sentence, and Codex doubled an engine's propeller:

2
00:00:03,514 --> 00:00:06,086
blades from 1,217.5 mm

3
00:00:06,106 --> 00:00:07,860
to 2,435 mm.

4
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:10,307
Early October, @earthtojake posted

5
00:00:10,327 --> 00:00:11,761
that the text-to-cad plugin

6
00:00:11,781 --> 00:00:13,469
is live in the Codex desktop app:

7
00:00:13,489 --> 00:00:15,870
open source, free, runs locally.

8
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:17,592
Twelve skills sit behind it.

9
00:00:17,612 --> 00:00:20,396
Describe a part in plain words and get a STEP file,

10
00:00:20,416 --> 00:00:22,930
or export STL, 3MF and GLB.

11
00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:24,929
Drawing is not enough; it has to be buildable.

12
00:00:24,949 --> 00:00:27,111
Printing, sheet metal, CNC

13
00:00:27,131 --> 00:00:29,290
and injection moulding each get a manufacturability check.

14
00:00:29,310 --> 00:00:30,790
But the skill's own notes say it:

15
00:00:30,810 --> 00:00:32,880
a guided review, not a manufacturing certification.

16
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:35,339
The Bambu and SendCutSend links are handoffs:

17
00:00:35,359 --> 00:00:38,660
starting a print or placing an order is still up to a person.

18
00:00:38,710 --> 00:00:41,143
First release in April, past 10,000 stars in late July,

19
00:00:41,163 --> 00:00:43,370
and 16.6k when read on October 4.

20
00:00:43,390 --> 00:00:45,767
The July demo ran in Claude Code: a humanoid robot

21
00:00:45,787 --> 00:00:48,700
pulled apart, a dexterous hand making a fist.

22
00:00:48,750 --> 00:00:50,152
Two commands to install:

23
00:00:50,172 --> 00:00:53,374
marketplace add, then plugin add.

24
00:00:53,394 --> 00:00:56,520
It needs Codex 0.142 or newer, and uv installed first.

25
00:00:56,540 --> 00:00:57,833
The demo is sped up:

26
00:00:57,853 --> 00:01:00,640
the on-screen timer had already passed four minutes.

27
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:03,660
A third-party open-source plugin, not made by OpenAI.

28
00:01:03,680 --> 00:01:05,843
On Windows 11 with Smart App Control on,

29
00:01:05,863 --> 00:01:07,080
its core library gets blocked.

30
00:01:07,100 --> 00:01:08,246
A drawing changes with one sentence;

31
00:01:08,266 --> 00:01:10,890
whether it can be built still needs a check first.
